354	  // operation order. Each actually-changed document appends one record; a
355	  // normalized-identical replace or restore appends nothing. Returns
356	  // `{ snapshot, changed }` without persisting when `dryRun` is true or the
357	  // batch is content-preserving.
358	  function commitBatch(operations, dryRun) {
